w.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\"><mo>:=</mo></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Re</mi><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">|</mo><mi>α</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. <em>Name the move, then complete it:</em>\nshow that <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"J = \\langle q \\rangle\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E9\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>q</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and\nthat <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"q\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is irreducible over <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch05-polynomials-over-a-field/06-the-fundamental-theorem.html"}